<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Watchdog<sp/>Example:<sp/>Servicing<sp/>Watchdog</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">This<sp/>example<sp/>demonstrates<sp/>how<sp/>to<sp/>service<sp/>the<sp/>watchdog<sp/>or<sp/>generate<sp/>a<sp/>wakeup<sp/>interrupt<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>watchdog<sp/>on<sp/>the<sp/>F28E12x<sp/>device.<sp/>By<sp/>default,<sp/>the<sp/>example<sp/>generates<sp/>a<sp/>wakeup<sp/>interrupt.<sp/>To<sp/>service<sp/>the<sp/>watchdog<sp/>and<sp/>avoid<sp/>generating<sp/>the<sp/>interrupt,<sp/>uncomment<sp/>the<sp/>`SysCtl_serviceWatchdog()`<sp/>line<sp/>in<sp/>the<sp/>main<sp/>loop.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
